the knowledge base not_example includes:

the text of the source program is at "sources/not-example.l4".

is clean if
    it is not the case that has criminal record.

can access if
    the person age is a number N
    and N >= 18
    and it is not the case that is blocked.

a boolean has access for a second boolean if
    true is equal to the boolean
    or it is not the case that true is equal to the second boolean.

not athen b for a boolean with a second boolean if
    it is not the case that
        true is equal to the boolean
        and true is equal to the second boolean.

not both for a value with a second value if
    it is not the case that
        true is equal to the value
        and true is equal to the second value.

a number is not zero if
    it is not the case that 0 is equal to the number.

a value V is not positive if
    it is not the case that V > 0.

the inverted message for a flag is a text if
    it is not the case that true is equal to the flag
    and the text is equal to "flag is off"
    otherwise the text is equal to "flag is on".

